# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test fixtures are COMMITTED ON PURPOSE — see docs/DATA-NOTES.md.
# The real NSE bhavcopy response is a .zip, and the golden screener.in pages are
# .html. The `*.zip` / `*.jar` rules from the original BlueJ-era template were
# dropped because they would silently exclude the golden files the parser tests
# assert against. `*.jar` in particular would have excluded gradle/wrapper/,
# which the build needs.
#
# Binary build output that must stay out is already covered by build/ and
# .gradle/ above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CI failure logs: uploaded from GitHub Actions for debugging. Never committed.
logs_*/
*.zip
!gradle/wrapper/*.zip
